Firmware: none committed. The driver loads iwlwifi-<name>-<api>.ucode (and
iwlwifi-<name>.pnvm for AX210/AX211) from /lib/firmware on disk and names the
missing file in the kernel log if it is not there.

mvm/iwx_sae.c also uses facts (MGMT_MCAST_KEY 0x1f command layout, STA_KEY_FLG_CCM,
STA_KEY_MFP) from Linux drivers/net/wireless/intel/iwlwifi/fw/api/sta.h and mvm/sta.c,
