constants (STA_HE_CTXT_CMD 0x7 v1-v3 = struct iwl_he_sta_context_cmd_v1/v2/v3, pkt_ext,
STA_CTXT_HE_* flags, MAC_FILTER_IN_11AX, IWL_TLC_MNG_MODE_HE, IWL_TLC_MNG_CFG_FLAGS_LDPC,
NVM_MAC_SKU_FLAGS_802_11AX_ENABLED) from Linux drivers/net/wireless/intel/iwlwifi/fw/api/
mac.h, datapath.h, rs.h, nvm-reg.h, SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause,
